Literal searching

Pattern parsing

single character: # any; @ alpha; ~@ nonalpha; % blank; ~% nonblank;
min sequence: * any; & alpha; ~& nonalpha; $ blank; ~$ nonblank;
max sequence: ** any; && alpha; ~&~& nonalpha; $$ blank; ~$~$ nonblank;
miscellaneous: 'x = use x; ~x = not x; { } selection; | boundary; < > named subpattern

Searching

Replacement
